Cell[TextData[{"Use ", Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{ButtonBox["StringSplit", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:ref/StringSplit"], "[", RowBox[{StyleBox["value", "TI"], ",", ButtonBox["HTMLWhitespace", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MaximilienTirard/HTMLPatterns/ref/HTMLWhitespace"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula"], " to split the value of an attribute such as ", Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["class", "TR"]], "InlineFormula"], " or ", Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["rel", "TR"]], "InlineFormula"], " as a browser does."}], "Notes"],

